  <spirit:description>Drives an ICM-20948 IMU and AK09916 magnetometer over SPI and streams timestamped IMU samples to a downstream FIFO over AXI4-Stream. On reset, a table-driven setup sequence initializes and verifies both devices, flagging any failure for ILA debugging. Once setup completes, each IMU interrupt triggers a 15-word burst containing the event timestamp followed by packed accelerometer, gyroscope, temperature, and magnetometer readings.</spirit:description>
